    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天，上美术课，老师给大家出了一个题目—“画你最好的朋友”，然后就回办公室了。",
      "traditional": "一天，上美術課，老師給大家出了一個題目—“畫你最好的朋友”，然後就回辦公室了。",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān shàng měi shù kè lǎo shī gěi dà jiā chū le yí ge tí mù huà nǐ zuì hǎo de péng you rán hòu jiù huí bàn gōng shì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n   ",
      "traditional": "\n   ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "One day in arts class, the teacher gave everyone the task “paint your best friend”, and then went back to the office."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "十分钟后，小红哭着来到老师办公室，她的脸上全是颜料。",
      "traditional": "十分鐘後，小紅哭著來到老師辦公室，她的臉上全是顏料。",
      "pinyin": "shí fēn zhōng hòu xiǎo hóng kū zhe lái dào lǎo shī bàn gōng shì tā de liǎn shang quán shì yán liào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n   ",
      "traditional": "\n   ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ten minutes later, Little Hong came to the teacher's office crying, with her face covered in paint."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "老师问：“这是怎么回事？”",
      "traditional": "老師問：“這是怎麼回事？”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī wèn zhè shì zěn me huí shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n   ",
      "traditional": "\n   ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The teacher asked: “What happened?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小红哭着回答：“小明他在我脸上画画。”",
      "traditional": "小紅哭著回答：“小明他在我臉上畫畫。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hóng kū zhe huí dá xiǎo míng tā zài wǒ liǎn shang huà huà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n   ",
      "traditional": "\n   ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Hong replied crying: “Little Ming painted on my face.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "老师找到小明，小明很无辜地说：",
      "traditional": "老師找到小明，小明很無辜地說：",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī zhǎo dào xiǎo míng xiǎo míng hěn wú gū de shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "“老师，您不是让我“画你最好的朋友”吗？小红是我最好的朋友呀。”",
      "traditional": "“老師，您不是讓我“畫你最好的朋友”嗎？小紅是我最好的朋友呀。”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī nín bú shì ràng wǒ huà nǐ zuì hǎo de péng you ma xiǎo hóng shì wǒ zuì hǎo de péng you ya",
      "english": "The teacher found Little Ming, but Little Ming said innocently:"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n   ",
      "traditional": "\n   ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“Teacher, didn't you ask us to paint our best friends? Little Hong is my best friend.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "老师很无奈地说：",
      "traditional": "老師很無奈地說：",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī hěn wú nài de shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "“小明，我是让你在纸上画出你最好的朋友，不是让你把画画在你最好的朋友脸上！”",
      "traditional": "“小明，我是讓你在紙上畫出你最好的朋友，不是讓你把畫畫在你最好的朋友臉上！”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng wǒ shì ràng nǐ zài zhǐ shang huà chū nǐ zuì hǎo de péng you bú shì ràng nǐ bǎ huà huà zài nǐ zuì hǎo de péng you liǎn shang",
      "english": "The teacher said despondently:"
    }
  ],
