      "Drawing a Painting",
      "",
      "One day in arts class, the teacher gave everyone the task “paint your best friend”, and then went back to the office.",
      "",
      "Ten minutes later, Little Hong came to the teacher's office crying, with her face covered in paint.",
      "",
      "The teacher asked: “What happened?”",
      "",
      "Little Hong replied crying: “Little Ming painted on my face.”",
      "",
      "The teacher found Little Ming, but Little Ming said innocently:",
      "“Teacher, didn't you ask us to paint our best friends? Little Hong is my best friend.”",
      "",
      "The teacher said despondently:",
      "“Little Ming, I asked you to draw your best friend on a piece of paper, not to draw a painting on your best friend's face.”"
    ]
